# Built native extension (per-build, not committed).
build/
_native_klu*.so
_native_klu*.pyd

# The vendor/ tree is the EXCEPTION to the repo-wide *.so ignore: its
# prebuilt SuiteSparse and GCC runtime shared libraries are committed so the
# wheel builds with no conda or system SuiteSparse and no network access.
# Negate the *.so ignore for everything under vendor/.
!vendor/
!vendor/**
